    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "A recent survey shows that more than half of young Chinese people have a hard time clearly "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b1",
            "number": 1,
            "hint": {
              "baseWord": "express"
            }
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " themselves. Experts say this is partly due to the rise of social media. When we chat online, we often use "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "memes",
            "zh": "热梗"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " instead of words."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "The survey was done by "
          },
          {
            "t": "em",
            "v": "China Youth Daily"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". They asked 1,333 people, mostly "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b2",
            "number": 2
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " their 20s and 30s. Over 60% of them have a "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "bachelor’s degree",
            "zh": "学士学位"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " or higher. Among "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b3",
            "number": 3
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " surveyed, 47.1% reported poor "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "verbal",
            "zh": "语言的"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " skills, and 43.2% said they don’t write with a pen very often."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "The survey also asked about the cause. Fifty-three per cent of people said the problem "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b4",
            "number": 4,
            "hint": {
              "baseWord": "cause"
            }
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " by the overuse of memes in their daily lives. Also, 54% admitted that they don’t read as much as they used to."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Some experts have noticed the problem, too. Guo Xiao’an, a professor at Chongqing University, studied "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b5",
            "number": 5
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " young Chinese people talk online. “"
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b6",
            "number": 6
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " vocabulary hasn’t changed much,” he said. “But they rely too much on "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "internet slang",
            "zh": "网络流行语"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ".”"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p5",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "On Chinese social media, "
          },
          {
            "t": "em",
            "v": "shiyu"
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "",
            "zh": "失语"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b7",
            "number": 7,
            "hint": {
              "baseWord": "be"
            }
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " a hot topic in recent years. Since 2021, more than 380,000 Douban users have joined a group to ask "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b8",
            "number": 8
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " advice on how to clearly express their thoughts and ideas."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p6",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "According to the survey, 58.4% believed "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b9",
            "number": 9,
            "hint": {
              "baseWord": "read"
            }
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " more books is a good way to fix this. And nearly half said that they should meet people in person more often. They believed this could give them more chances "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b10",
            "number": 10,
            "hint": {
              "baseWord": "practise"
            }
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " their verbal skills. “They’re right,” said Zheng Huanzhao, a professor at Jinan University. “But we also need to make the language environment better.”"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
